                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Bahan 2 -->
                        <div class="bg-cream p-5 rounded-2xl border border-espresso/10 hover:border-caramel transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2.5">
                                <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-espresso/10 text-espresso flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">02</span>
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-espresso">Kakao Couverture, Belgia</h4>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-sm text-espresso/70 leading-relaxed">
                                Cokelat hitam 72% single-estate yang dilelehkan perlahan untuk tekstur beludru yang lumer sempurna di lidah.
                            </p>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Bahan 3 -->
                        <div class="bg-cream p-5 rounded-2xl border border-espresso/10 hover:border-caramel transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2.5">
                                <span class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-mint/20 text-mint flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">03</span>
                                <h4 class="font-serif font-bold text-lg text-espresso">Matcha Uji, Kyoto Jepang</h4>
                            </div>
